ow kills it."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-40796","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66445","text":"Why "},{"id":"spn-66446","marks":["code"],"text":"WIDX"},{"id":"spn-66447","text":" 3→2 does not work — the route budget already forbids it"}]},{"id":"blk-40797","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66448","text":"The target index is "},{"id":"spn-66449","marks":["bold"],"text":"per-kind scoped"},{"id":"spn-66450","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-66451","marks":["code"],"text":"SetRotor"},{"id":"spn-66452","text":"→spinners, "},{"id":"spn-66453","marks":["code"],"text":"ResetFault"},{"id":"spn-66454","text":"→orbs, "},{"id":"spn-66455","marks":["code"],"text":"Send"},{"id":"spn-66456","text":"→mailboxes), and an out-of-fixture target packs to the sentinel "},{"id":"spn-66457","marks":["code"],"text":"len(targets)"},{"id":"spn-66458","text":". So "},{"id":"spn-66459","marks":["code"],"text":"WIDX"},{"id":"spn-66460","text":" bounds "},{"id":"spn-66461","marks":["italic"],"text":"each"},{"id":"spn-66462","text":" kind at "},{"id":"spn-66463","marks":["code"],"text":"2^WIDX - 1"},{"id":"spn-66464","text":" targets."}]},{"id":"blk-40798","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66465","text":"A world with the "},{"id":"spn-66466","marks":["bold"],"text":"full ruled budget of 6 routes pointing at 6 distinct mailboxes seals cleanly"},{"id":"spn-66467","text":" under every commit-4 law — I built one:"}]},{"id":"blk-40799","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SEALS OK: 6 routes -> 6 distinct mailboxes ['mb0'..'mb5']\nhighest real mailbox_index = 5 ; sentinel (INVALID_TARGET) = 6\n  WIDX=3 (indices 0..7): fits\n  WIDX=2 (indices 0..3): *** OVERFLOWS ***"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-40801","spans":[{"id":"spn-66468","text":"mailboxes"}]},{"id":"blk-40802","spans":[{"id":"spn-66469","text":"sentinel"}]},{"id":"blk-40803","spans":[{"id":"spn-66470","marks":["code"],"text":"WIDX=3"}]},{"id":"blk-40804","spans":[{"id":"spn-66471","marks":["code"],"text":"WIDX=2"}]}],"id":"blk-40800","kind":"tab